{
  "day": 4,
  "beats": {
    "boot": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The rain is heavier. The water on the window runs in lines."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Changelog v4.3. A single dash. Nothing about what changed.",
          "where": "screen:workbench:docs"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "A new version with no changelog. Where I work that is an incident. Here it is an update.",
          "where": "screen"
        }
      ]
    },
    "box": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today's loose one is flat. An IC card, the magnetic strip scuffed, the corners whitened, rows of pinch marks."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "I see."
        }
      ]
    },
    "desk": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You set the pager beside the chick. Two things, one black, one yellow."
        }
      ]
    },
    "shutdown": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You switch off the lamp. The room goes fully dark; only the chick's little screen keeps a trace of light."
        }
      ]
    },
    "night": {
      "say": [
        {
          "k": "sfx",
          "t": "Bzzz.",
          "sfx": "pager-buzz"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The desk shudders once. One short, loud knock, like a knuckle rapped inside the wood."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "A string of digits on the pager's screen."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "寻呼机",
          "t": "0.7734"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You reach for Kuro's little window. Before your hand gets there the pager buzzes half a buzz. Only then does the window light up."
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "The pager knew before Kuro did."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You close your eyes. A card between your fingers, a row of nail marks down its edge."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "First week of junior high. The shop by the school gate; the owner slides a phone card out of the drawer like dealing a hand."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "小卖部老板",
          "t": "Five kuai. Fifty minutes. Make them last."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The payphones stand by the gate, three in a row, a queue behind each."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "同学",
          "t": "Hurry up, there's people waiting!"
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "family",
          "t": "Hello? ... Have you eaten? Do you have enough money?"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "Enough."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "family",
          "t": "Good. Is it cold there? I can't hear you, speak up."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "The number on the little screen ticks down. You put what you want to say in a queue, most important first."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Halfway through a sentence it cuts out. The card is at zero."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "同学",
          "t": "Done yet? My turn!"
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "You pull the card out. A piece of plastic with no money on it. You don't throw it away."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Later it turns out to have one more use: on early mornings, before the key arrives, the classroom door's latch is slanted, and a card can push it back."
        },
        {
          "k": "speaker",
          "who": "同学",
          "t": "Hey, how did you get in?"
        },
        {
          "k": "inner",
          "t": "It said IC on the card. Back then I read it as I see."
        },
        {
          "k": "narration",
          "t": "Today is over."
        }
      ]
    }
  },
